#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: pikari-gutenberg-query-filter.php
msgid "Pikari Gutenberg Query Filter"
msgstr "Pikari Gutenberg Query Filter"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: pikari-gutenberg-query-filter.php
msgid "https://github.com/HelloPikari/pikari-gutenberg-query-filter"
msgstr "https://github.com/HelloPikari/pikari-gutenberg-query-filter"

#. Description of the plugin
#: pikari-gutenberg-query-filter.php
msgid ""
"Advanced filtering for Query Loop blocks with search, post types, "
"taxonomies, authors, and sorting. Integrates seamlessly with WordPress core "
"blocks using the Interactivity API."
msgstr ""
"Filtrage avancé pour les blocs de boucle de requête avec recherche, types de "
"publication, taxonomies, auteurs et tri. S’intègre parfaitement aux blocs "
"natifs de WordPress via l’API d’interactivité."

